只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Academic literature search, citation and BibTeX tools for DeepSeek Harness and any agent (Crossref + OpenAlex). dsh plugin + CLI + SKILL.md.","id":"gh:1347297726","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-lit-search","slug":"Flan246/dsh-lit-search","topics":["bibtex","citation","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","literature"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Academic literature search, citation and BibTeX tools for DeepSeek Harness and any agent (Crossref +"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" OpenAlex). dsh plugin + CLI + SKILL.md."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-lit-search"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Academic literature search, citation and BibTeX tools for DeepSeek Harness and\nany agent. One packag"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e, three forms: dsh Cordis plugin, standalone CLI, and an\nagent skill."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Merged search** — keyword search across Crossref, OpenAlex and Semantic\nScholar, deduplicated by"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" DOI, with title/authors/year/venue/citation counts.\nFilter by publication year (`--from`/`--to`) an"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"d sort by citations, date or\nrelevance (`--sort`).\n- **Citation formatting** — GB/T 7714 (default, f"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"or Chinese theses), GB/T 7714\nnumeric (`[1]`-style, `gbt7714-numeric`), APA, BibTeX.\n- **Batch BibTe"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"X** — generate a combined `.bib` for a list of DOIs, with the\nfailed DOIs reported separately.\n- **R"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"elated works** — related papers for a DOI via OpenAlex `related_works`."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 1. dsh plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Registers four agent tools: `lit_search`, `lit_cite`, `lit_bib`, `lit_related`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 2. Standalone CLI"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"All commands print human-readable text by default; pass `--json` before the\nsubcommand (e.g. `npx ds"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"h-lit-search --json search \"transformers\"`) for\nmachine output. Exit codes: `0` success, `1` busines"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"s error, `2` usage error."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 3. Agent skill"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Copy `skill/` into `~/.agents/skills/dsh-lit-search/` (or your agent's skill\ndirectory). The skill t"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ells the agent to run the CLI above."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Data sources"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Crossref — DOI metadata and works search.\n- OpenAlex — works search, citation counts, related work"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"s.\n- Semantic Scholar — works search, citation counts."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"All are free public APIs; no API key required. HTTP goes through a single\nlayer with a 10s timeout, "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"one retry on 5xx/network errors, and a polite\n`mailto:` User-Agent."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## MCP server (Claude Code, Cursor, ChatGPT, ...)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Use dsh-lit-search from any MCP host via the companion package\n`dsh-lit-search-mcp`\n(listed on the o"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"fficial MCP Registry as `io.github.Flan246/dsh-lit-search`):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"or in any MCP host's config: `\"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"dsh-lit-search-mcp\"]`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
